        "original_id": "0b5d1ce4-7e02-597c-b36d-56a3c60e0755",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Liam Cunningham, Michael Fassbender, Keith Barron\n- Works: Police 2020, Hex\n- Characters: DCI Billy O'Connell, Eddie Longshaw, Azazeal\n- Topics: Irish actors, British television\n\nFacts:\n- Liam Cunningham, born on 2 June 1961, is an Irish stage and screen actor.\n- Michael Fassbender, born on 2 April 1977, is an Irish actor.\n- In the near-future pilot Police 2020, Liam Cunningham starred as DCI Billy O'Connell, the head of a police nightshift force.\n- In Police 2020, DCI Billy O'Connell is tasked with confronting Eddie Longshaw, played by Keith Barron, after Eddie takes a group of Russian immigrants hostage in an elevator.\n- In Police 2020, Eddie Longshaw blames the immigrant population for a tuberculosis outbreak that killed most of his family.\n- Azazeal is a fictional character in the British television series Hex, and Michael Fassbender played Azazeal.",
